{
  "id": "r01-l03",
  "unit": "r01-signs",
  "title": "Please, on a sign",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Signs ask politely with **-উন** commands: **খুলুন**, **রাখুন**, **ফেলুন**, **করুন**. In everyday Bangladeshi speech you say **খোলেন**, **রাখেন**, **ফেলেন**. Same meaning, written style.\n\n**অনুগ্রহ করে** is the written 'please' (speech: **দয়া করে**). **স্থান** is the written word for **জায়গা** 'place', and **পরিচ্ছন্ন** for **পরিষ্কার** 'clean'.\n\n**Conjuncts:** **স্থ** = স + থ (**স্থান** *sthan*). **র্দ** has a ref on দ and **ষ্ট** is ষ + ট: **নির্দিষ্ট** *nirdishto*. **চ্ছ** is চ + ছ: **পরিচ্ছন্ন**.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "onugroho-kore",
      "bn": "অনুগ্রহ করে",
      "tr": "onugroho kore",
      "en": "please (formal, written)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: দয়া করে. Lit. 'doing a kindness'. গ্র = গ + র (ro-fola)."
    },
    {
      "id": "onurodh",
      "bn": "অনুরোধ",
      "tr": "onurodh",
      "en": "request",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written)."
    },
    {
      "id": "felun",
      "bn": "ফেলুন",
      "tr": "felun",
      "en": "please throw; put (standard)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: ফেলেন. -উন: the written polite command (everyday BD speech says ফেলেন)."
    },
    {
      "id": "khulun",
      "bn": "খুলুন",
      "tr": "khulun",
      "en": "please take off; open (standard)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: খোলেন. -উন: the written polite command. জুতা খুলুন 'please take off your shoes'."
    },
    {
      "id": "rakhun",
      "bn": "রাখুন",
      "tr": "rakhun",
      "en": "please keep (standard)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: রাখেন. -উন command on signs: বন্ধ রাখুন 'keep switched off'. Everyday BD speech says রাখেন."
    },
    {
      "id": "byabohar",
      "bn": "ব্যবহার",
      "tr": "byabohar",
      "en": "use",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). ব্যবহার করুন 'please use'. Also 'behaviour'. ব্য = ব + য (jo-fola)."
    },
    {
      "id": "nirdishto",
      "bn": "নির্দিষ্ট",
      "tr": "nirdishto",
      "en": "designated; set",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). র্দ (ref on দ) + ষ্ট (ষ + ট)."
    },
    {
      "id": "sthan",
      "bn": "স্থান",
      "tr": "sthan",
      "en": "place",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: জায়গা. স্থ = স + থ."
    },
    {
      "id": "sthane",
      "bn": "স্থানে",
      "tr": "sthane",
      "en": "in the place; at the place",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: জায়গায়."
    },
    {
      "id": "porichchhonno",
      "bn": "পরিচ্ছন্ন",
      "tr": "porichchhonno",
      "en": "clean; tidy",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: পরিষ্কার. চ্ছ (চ + ছ) and ন্ন (ন + ন)."
    }
  ],
